      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAVISHING SLOY (4) has been producing some decent efforts from wide barriers at Menangle of late. He strikes at 50 per cent here including a win the only time he raced over this distance so is better placed and well served by this low draw. MONTALBANO (5) led and boxed on for fourth last start at Menangle, beaten 6 metres. Proven at this circuit and distance and looks capable of playing a major role. TIGER PRINCE (7) draws for a trail and is in contention after finishing in the placings for the second time in a row last start, beaten 3 metres into second. JILLIBY FABIO (8) is in the mix following a fourth from a similar draw at his most recent appearance and he owns a solid record here.",
